    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just not even about needing a nap or a weekend off. i mean it’s like... i’m constantly performing. i have to pretend to care about stuff, pretend to be okay, and it’s just so draining. i feel like i've been fighting this battle for years and i'm just done. i'm just so finished with the effort of it all.",
