      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the curtain fall...\" that's an interesting way to put it. it feels like if i actually stopped performing, there wouldn't be anything left. just a huge void. it's like there's no way to actually get that rest you're talking about while i'm still stuck in this life. is there even a way to find actual peace when everything is this heavy?",
